<title>USA: V-One Corp Q3 net, share loss deepens.</title>
<headline>V-One Corp Q3 net, share loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.11     loss	 $0.01</p>
<p> Net loss		     978     loss	    61</p>
<p> Revs			 1,721			356</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,644		    9,606</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.63     loss	$ 0.05</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,366     loss	   460</p>
<p> Revs			 4,097			725</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,547		    9,315</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said that it would be recording a further non-cash compensation expense of approximately $264,000 during Q4 1996 as a result of the pricing on its IPO on Oct 24,1996. The total non-cash compensation expense arising from the IPO is approximately $2,784,000.</p>
